  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">123 Health Tech</strong></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Welcome to 123 Health Tech, where we believe great days start with better sleep. We are dedicated to revolutionizing your rest with our innovative temperature-controlled mattress system, designed to create the perfect sleep environment tailored to your body every single night.</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Inspired by sleep science, our technology allows you to actively cool or heat your bed, addressing the root cause of many sleep disturbances: thermal discomfort. Experience the profound benefits of deeper, more restorative sleep, including accelerated muscle recovery, enhanced daily energy, and improved overall well-being.</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Our flagship system stands out with its powerful dual-zone temperature control, allowing each side of the bed to be personalized. It operates whisper-quiet, is highly energy-efficient, and requires no ongoing subscription fees. Whether you're a couple with different preferences, a shift worker battling daytime heat, or an athlete focused on recovery, 123 Health Tech provides a science-backed solution to help you wake up feeling restored and ready to perform at your best. Join us in unlocking the transformative power of personalized sleep.</p></div>",
